      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Era sheet: Highsun 1, 955 BF, Peach's Castle.</em> Art and stats describe this figure on the night of the Day Of (events.json <code>highsun_1_955_bf_the_day_of</code>), not the present day of the campaign (1040 BF).</p><p>Violet hooded robe with silver sigils, crystal-topped staff, scroll satchel. The record says two hooded Mages' Guild mages conferred with Mayor Thornpaw tonight. Whose side they are on is the GM's call; this sheet works for a loyal court magician and for a conspirator.</p><p><em>Alternate tokens:</em> <code>portraits/peachs-castle-955/court-mage-b.png</code>, <code>portraits/peachs-castle-955/court-mage-c.png</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
